## Program Outcome

Tool Shed preserves distinct document, outcome, reconciliation, and recursive-closure states while
preventing contradictory closeout claims, safely repairing inherited inconsistencies, and reporting
queued, working, completed, and closure-blocked work truthfully. The correction is proven on clean
installations and historical upgrades before production release.

